        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed House 2 is a very unusual game — even by our own standards. Almost all of its mechanics are unique and unlike anything in our other games. It’s purely a Match-3 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 15 groups of levels (142 in total ). Each group comes with its own unique objective and custom power-ups designed specifically for that objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a group is completed, you can replay those levels, including in a timed mode. Overall, the game is quite challenging, though it’s less puzzle-like compared to our other titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re thrilled to finally add this game to our collection!</p>",
